only about 10 of the brain's mass yet it contains&nbsp;
an amazing 80 percent of the neuronal total&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.240 --> 00:05:02.320
and it works in coordination with cerebral cortex&nbsp;
and other circuits to coordinate our movements&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:10.320
and also our thoughts the rest of the brain is&nbsp;
less than 10 of brain mass contains fewer than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:18.800
one percent of all the neuronal accounts uh and it&nbsp;
contains literally hundreds of subcortical nuclei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:25.200
and subnuclei that are collectively responsible&nbsp;
for quite a wide variety of critically important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:33.280
housekeeping functions to handle our thirst&nbsp;
and hunger and many other drives and behaviors&nbsp;&nbsp;

